From 7dec8ba8f0a2f2aee058997c783f3dad4cb3848f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Adam Wien <adam.wien@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 17:53:10 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Add SHINING 3D Einstar camera driver (libeinstar)

New CameraEinstar RGB-D driver backed by the open-source libeinstar
userspace driver: depth from the scanner's IR stereo pair registered to
its colour camera, calibration read from the scanner. Optional
dependency (WITH_EINSTAR). Available in Preferences > Source > RGB-D and
as driver 18 in rtabmap-camera, including a replay mode.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
